{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "00a9d5bd97c269b44f954c91d6a2f8afd4bcd35fa8b503c4af6fd1212f619c82", "ja": "道", "zh": "道路", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d30d79f465af2ef337c89d76344cc575a243b06db551589ab93f9cb90a4bf9a5", "ja": "本番直前、屋上で765プロに入ってからの\nことを振り返っていた春香は、探しに来た\n千早とともに、これまでとこれからに思い\nを馳せた後に舞台袖に移動。仲間に声をか\nけ、オールスターライブに臨む！", "zh": "在正式开场前，春香在屋顶回顾进入\n765艺能后的种种，并与前来找她的千早一起\n回忆过去、展望未来，之后便前往舞台侧边，\n跟伙伴们一起打气，迎接群星演唱会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bf4ef33df98d20fb10ab565ed74ea06c98b14ea88bbf0622eac48635a99b5689", "ja": "（そして、いよいよオールスターライブ当日……！）", "zh": "（接着，终于来到群星演唱会当天……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c52732617aeb5974a9e10e837001e90d7ac22e47eef89bf826d64df42849ac88", "ja": "おっ、いたいた。千早、こっちこっち！", "zh": "喔，找到了。千早，这边这边！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "b32639f9187bada4bc9920db33d85ae400fa0526dffabd460b71ce2edb80be18", "ja": "{$P$}さん？　千早ちゃんも……。\nあ！　もしかして、もうスタンバイですか！？", "zh": "{$P$}先生？还有千早……\n啊！该不会已经要准备上场了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "a65aeb2ca10f0470cdcbac866f83d9f67f380183f5ea33f63454a9b8b2f24988", "ja": "ええ、そろそろ……。", "zh": "是的，差不多了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1005_p", "source_sha256": "725789b75b6f5f426ecb0c93a89ef9a77c0c20c4fdc4d135cfb7971bdf8b7f76", "ja": "でも、どうしたんだ？\nひとりで精神集中でもしてたのか？", "zh": "但你怎么了？\n自己一个人在集中精神吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "365c654bc4ad35b3b38f54efd1a6f48b9c0798a5302c1249dd51fbf8f900a14d", "ja": "い、いえ、そんなんじゃないです。ただ……ちょっと、\n今までいろいろあったな～って、思い出してただけで。", "zh": "不、不是这样的，我只是……\n觉得至今发生了好多事啊～这样而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "5b45fa61f6bf433e915f6e49b25edea51f964afa05ef593ad3bbb0f40a5873fe", "ja": "765プロに入ってすぐのころは、まだ10人しか\nアイドルがいなかったんだっけ、とか……。", "zh": "像是刚进入765艺能时，\n还只有10个偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "6c9182a8c4d48f7e6a91f1f8ffb5d175b7710cf5ac9beee189fa1033c2614253", "ja": "そういえば……。\nそうだったわね。", "zh": "这么说来……\n的确是这样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "8c86cdc0dcf002d16efe8da444639615a2f78149798d095baa7549afbbcd4296", "ja": "じゃあ10人で一緒に頑張ろう！\nって思ってたら、すぐに美希が入ってきて。", "zh": "当时想着那就10个人一起努力吧，\n然后紧接着美希就加入了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "d0550bb5c0b6d40a347de24fbab9175c56fff4956ef59bedd9c5d8afb7e1d792", "ja": "それから、我那覇さんと四条さんも加わって……。", "zh": "之后再加上我那霸和四条……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "155a269eab24ac4af86e6d5f925f984ede795c8c54fa3df23554661a981dfdd4", "ja": "うん。765プロは13人になって……\n13人で、いろんなことをがんばって。", "zh": "嗯，765艺能变成13个人……\n13个人一起努力跨越各种关卡。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "069ac6082ef0b03afa4b66f7fe65d4c85866ff76bf02ef1ec42aa913a6a68a89", "ja": "いろいろな場所で、いろいろな歌をうたって。\n……いろいろな経験をして。", "zh": "在各式各样的地方，唱了各式各样的歌。\n……经历了各式各样的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1013_p", "source_sha256": "1bfbe55616c8136be3db8eb1c7f45f6adb4001afa17a389f7e539a603610130a", "ja": "みんな、そろそろ一人前になってきたと、思い始めた\n頃だったかな。社長がこの劇場を作ったのは……。", "zh": "大概就在我开始觉得大家差不多能独当一面时，\n社长盖了这座剧场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "f9a700c169777b68d74ccf3eccc8a26f87f9117ea9f6eb62b44e8d9f8d8ad63f", "ja": "ふふっ、ビックリしちゃいましたよね！　いきなり\n事務所に入りきれないくらいの仲間ができて！", "zh": "呵呵，那时的确吓了一跳呢！\n一下子多了好多新伙伴，多到根本无法全进到事务所来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1015_002chi", "source_sha256": "bb98bac5742fe2be19954312a0201490539488508e822d69f11609b86837fed0", "ja": "ほんとうに。こんなにもたくさんの……。\n仲間が、できるなんて。", "zh": "真的没想到，\n会得到这么多……伙伴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "1c9c7b15c11b3a23d23e76e71f0bbb5d72aa004ad769498a0022aedead392b1b", "ja": "それからも、またいろいろがんばって。もちろん\n大変なことも、ツラいこともあったけど……。", "zh": "在那之后，又挑战过好多好多事，\n当然也有辛苦难受的时候……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "afbc661103c6591e844bf059110cf4975396a005fba697f28c13aa3e195f20e2", "ja": "でも、アイドルになれてよかったって気持ちは、\n最初のころと全然変わらないの。", "zh": "但庆幸自己能成为偶像的那种感受，\n从一开始到现在都没变过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1018_001har", "source_sha256": "3592b80b02fde0bd76ea1fb4e6af349af6d867e415c34602cf7b0ffe656654d0", "ja": "ううん、最初のころより嬉しいくらい。\nこれって、きっと……。", "zh": "不，那份喜悦甚至比一开始更强烈，\n这一定是因为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "8b56f36733c9213cbeb8cef6b8e545c805b874823f5587d1bf589196e883c206", "ja": "アイドルになって出会えた人たちが、みんな……\nみんなみんな、素敵な人たちだからだって思ったんだ♪", "zh": "因为成为偶像后遇到的人……\n每一个都是很棒的人♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1020_002chi", "source_sha256": "c3e9a75e72799a16a50a3d87fdfa9af48cadd09ca580c5062aa8899bad92324b", "ja": "……。春香がそれを言うのね。\nふふっ……、ふふふっ！", "zh": "……春香竟然会说这些。\n呵呵……呵呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1021_001har", "source_sha256": "69f050bc2fb29eeecaabe73daff0c9b7ef0cf347d6787f5a06baf2b3ecc92c18", "ja": "えっ？　な、なにかヘンだった？", "zh": "咦？有、有什么奇怪的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1022_002chi", "source_sha256": "44673ea08847fe387c95781b52c839027fe6ba429d86d9427e3e3959e777ecf4", "ja": "ううん……、ごめんなさい、少しもヘンじゃないわ。\n春香らしいと思う。", "zh": "不……对不起，一点都不奇怪，\n我觉得这就是你会说的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1023_002chi", "source_sha256": "d2e95a18dea7a8aef517e2eebeec35c2556576abd31512d4d62fabda2e0b8a9a", "ja": "ただ、私は少し……違ったから。\nでも……今は同じ気持ちよ。", "zh": "只是我的心路历程……略有不同。\n但……我现在的心情跟你一样喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1024_001har", "source_sha256": "28f8c8dbe26c541d1f850e87f07f88fdf08552e60ff42b918dcb9388859e5b18", "ja": "千早ちゃん……。", "zh": "千早……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1025_p", "source_sha256": "64175c55d3dbcaa7abfdd51bdf4a9e44da8dd6fd7f61c97e889bbf7c44a0d030", "ja": "……そんな二人が引っ張ってくれたからこそ、\n今の765プロがあるんだと思う。", "zh": "……我想，正因为有你们两个在前方带领，\n才会有现在的765艺能。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1026_p", "source_sha256": "b7025a6baac16da985972dfde8157bb6e4ce9ccd10bdd658856e5b7c9d47cb3b", "ja": "ありがとう、春香、千早。", "zh": "春香、千早，谢谢你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1027_002chi", "source_sha256": "a4ed35ebab9e7a9170e31d4ff70339cea10d18bec91a62b373cd93616e2aab93", "ja": "……いえ。\nお礼を言うのは、私達の方かと。", "zh": "……不，\n该道谢的应该是我们才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1028_001har", "source_sha256": "4500844bac6b4ef137b19f8f8dd3077a693eea297b13d36c8846c50395a370cc", "ja": "そうですよ、{$P$}さん！\nずっと一緒に歩いてくれて、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "就是说呀，{$P$}先生！\n谢谢你一路陪伴我们前进♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1029_002chi", "source_sha256": "49f7029750ebfe95235d7eda142013a47e1c467c6f1c472f2c8fbf1dc14c17af", "ja": "でも……私達は、まだまだ道半ばです。\nまた前を向いて、歩みを進めましょう。", "zh": "不过……我们还在迈向目标的途中，\n未来就继续一同前进吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1030_p", "source_sha256": "a8ccc7763871d66547cffea02f4a5e82f905efac43480396255a434e8f6b9fe0", "ja": "そうだな。まだ誰も、どこにも辿りついてないんだ。\n二人とも、これからもよろしくな！", "zh": "是啊，我们都还没有抵达终点。\n两位，接下来也请多指教了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1031_001har", "source_sha256": "60605973617d64434178c48c8f2d61011588a09f7ef33eaabae88966e5cf8abb", "ja": "はいっ！　私たちは劇場のみんなより、\n少し早く歩き始めただけの先輩ですけど……。", "zh": "好的！\n我们只不过是比剧场的大家早几步出发的前辈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1032_001har", "source_sha256": "9ac88c6c6918eda4818810c2382f27b819aeb88c524d86792a8e2a2708d16be2", "ja": "だから、これからも先頭に立って！\n自分の夢に向かって、どんどん飛び込んで行きますね！", "zh": "但也因为如此，以后也要继续站在最前方！\n继续勇敢追寻自己的梦想！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1033_002chi", "source_sha256": "6bb653c59f63df3c0a1d88c7a905ac602ca5e9c8633d179ac77c7d531b301ad5", "ja": "ええ。行きましょう、春香。\nこれからも……顔を上げて、前を向いて！", "zh": "没错，我们走吧，春香。\n接下来也要……抬头挺胸、继续前进！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1034_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1035_001har", "source_sha256": "68241718d24e7bd745b311bfaf6e92ef26792fb31f01d73e136dc0568cc4ce26", "ja": "あああっ、みんなゴメン、お待たせ～！\nなんだか話し込んでたら遅くなっちゃった！", "zh": "啊啊啊，对不起大家，久等了～！\n聊着聊着不小心就晚到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1036_011ami", "source_sha256": "ba7240291482560b9b91437e9879cd41fc03e10a654b44bf96fd354dcdebf27a", "ja": "も～、心配したんだかんね、はるるん！\n人を心配させるのは亜美の役目っしょ！？", "zh": "真是的～大家很担心耶，小春春！\n让大家担心是亚美的工作才对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1037_007ior", "source_sha256": "8d1a0888d85da021c6cec0cd7db81ae480319e5a8e5469597c498c70c7f5d398", "ja": "全く、緊張感のかけらもないんだから。しかも千早と\n{$P$}まで……信じられないわ！", "zh": "根本一点紧张感都没有嘛，\n连千早和{$P$}也是……真不敢相信！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1038_002chi", "source_sha256": "b49d0e04c4935489b469fc4984f9c3421bdc6f5e2bd91ccd2d9bbb6e301fa623", "ja": "ご、ごめんなさい、水瀬さん。屋上で話していたら\n気持ちが高ぶってしまって、つい……。", "zh": "对、对不起，水濑。我们在顶楼讲话，\n讲到情绪高昂了起来，一不小心就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1039_p", "source_sha256": "f372e6ff91cca89c9c2d42e505126219a7f10ff799fa2a75a51e8cac7a29b83a", "ja": "面目ない……。", "zh": "真是惭愧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1040_003mik", "source_sha256": "34c1121e2d2d74c9d7eedace5cb2a0d5ae3648f545e367b7ab7c834bec3af5e7", "ja": "ていうか、まだステージに出なくていいの？\nさっき小鳥が泣きそうな声で様子見に来たよ？", "zh": "话说大家还不用出场吗？\n刚刚小鸟带着哭腔来看状况了喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1041_p", "source_sha256": "7e5255e66898596efaa2af4ff7068580e56236bf0f650f000a9f9e948d376ae6", "ja": "うわあ、そうだった！　下手のスタンバイもOKだな。\nよし、音を出すぞ。みんな、よろしくな！", "zh": "哇，对喔！似乎可以去舞台右侧准备了。\n好，来喊声吧，交给你们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
