{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_06_1043_001har", "source_sha256": "1b4521cb5fe5b8cb4d87323660981fb8b763374d3d2f539c318252fdc8550477", "ja": "うん！　それじゃあ……コホン！\nみんな、準備はいい？", "zh": "嗯！那么……咳咳！\n大家准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
